      "text": "Don Silvano Gaucho Ranch"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "6d97e0b96e6a76a7e4179539bcb0ebc99acef8c54b4d636b38b7b657a87a0b1a",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-d585b2821829f1fdbfcb5695",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, you head to Don Silvano Gaucho Ranch.\n\nHere you can learn about rural life in the Argentine Pampas and gaucho traditions. Walk around the grounds, see what daily life on the ranch is like, and watch a show featuring folk dancing and tango.\n\nThe highlight is a gaucho performance with demonstrations of lasso skills, horseback riding and jumping over obstacles. Guests can join in some of the games.\n\nFood is served at the end of the excursion, including Argentine meat.\n\n**Excursion duration:** 7 hours.\n\nThe rest of the afternoon is free."
    },
